  "description": "CR 709.3, 709.5d, 709.5e, 709.5h, 613.1f, 701.17a, 110.4a: Greenhouse, cast as a door, gives alice's lands \"{T}: Add one mana of any color\"; unlocking Rickety Gazebo mills four and returns up to two permanent cards from among them to her hand",
